    "description": "Bandhan Bank Advisory Limited invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Risk Analyst at our Pimpri-Chinchwad location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Bandhan Bank Advisory Limited:\nBandhan Bank Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable functions\n• Ensure compliance with tax regulations and statutory requirements\n• Liaise with banks, regulators, and financial institutions\n• Develop financial models and projections for business planning\n• Maintain general ledger and ensure accurate bookkeeping\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n• Implement and maintain internal controls and audit procedures\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in QuickBooks\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Ind AS\n• Proficiency in Credit Analysis\n• Proficiency in Python for Finance\n• Proficiency in Tally\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Referral bonus program\n• Learning & development budget\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Bandhan Bank Advisory Limited!",
